{"id":"vod_lz_51372","vodId":"51372","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"亲吻姐姐","name_cn":"亲吻姐姐","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230221-1/6cc93c2e3c8c434c8c143677e7c8fc89.jpg"},"summary":"住之江圭太是个临近高中升学考试的初中三年级男生。他在小时候由于父亲再婚，而和可爱的双胞胎姐妹·亚香和理香成为了姐弟。尽管没有血缘关系，三人也关系和睦地一同成长，但不知从何时开始，亚香和理香却似乎对圭太产生了恋情。看似是个认真的人、实际上是闷骚类型的亚香，以及虽然说话很冷淡、内在却很积极的理香。被两人所逼近的圭太，陷入了并非是由于应考学习所导致的、另一种意义上的困境","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-02-24 20:23:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4074_a7e09631/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4075_c14a344e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4077_4b9656ee/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4080_b3e729a4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4079_dd0ec0a7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4078_6e12769b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4081_cc0287b0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4082_fbd964be/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4083_91833061/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4085_8ff1b845/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4084_c07bf31f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4086_072e6fa9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4087_d6a74fca/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4088_c8ef4d17/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/20230224/4090_08cfdb41/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn17.com/